    {
      "id": "dnu7k5qf5scp7ueg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1550,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 1010.8000000000001,
      "height": 142.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 368559723,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2090640456,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794960000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Maekawa (Fano):   REQUEST + LOCKED + RELEASE para K = 3 nós   →   3(K−1) = 6 a 3K = 9 mensagens\nRicart-Agrawala:   REQUEST + REPLY para os N−1 = 6 outros nós   →   2(N−1) = 12 mensagens\n\nCom N grande a diferença cresce: Maekawa ~ 3√N, Ricart-Agrawala ~ 2N.\nEm troca, o Maekawa básico pode entrar em deadlock (espera circular de votos),\nresolvido com FAILED / INQUIRE / RELINQUISH e prioridade (Lamport, id).",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Maekawa (Fano):   REQUEST + LOCKED + RELEASE para K = 3 nós   →   3(K−1) = 6 a 3K = 9 mensagens\nRicart-Agrawala:   REQUEST + REPLY para os N−1 = 6 outros nós   →   2(N−1) = 12 mensagens\n\nCom N grande a diferença cresce: Maekawa ~ 3√N, Ricart-Agrawala ~ 2N.\nEm troca, o Maekawa básico pode entrar em deadlock (espera circular de votos),\nresolvido com FAILED / INQUIRE / RELINQUISH e prioridade (Lamport, id).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3w"
    },
